Package: bitbook
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Lars Larsen <larslarsen@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/larslarsen/bb-desktop
Depends: libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-3-0t64, libnotify4, libnss3, xdg-utils, libatspi2.0-0, libdrm2, libgbm1, libxcb-dri3-0
Recommends: pulseaudio | libasound2 | libasound2t64
Description: Barebones desktop client for the BitBook distributed social network
 BitBook provides signed profiles, posts, follows, and direct chat over an
 isolated peer-to-peer network without marketplace or wallet functionality.
